  id: liv.marked
  displayName: Marks of the Marked
  description: The elites carry the mark that made them what they are. Kill one, and bring its inscription home.
  chain: The Old Marks
  journalNotes: 'An elite''s ring names its mark: Frenzied, Ironhide, Frostbound and the rest. The deeper the raid, the likelier its inscription is on it, and it carries one you don''t know before one you do. The great creatures, the trolls and what lies under the roots, always carry their own great mark the first times you bring them down.'
